%SIXMD 1
# @?FSCK.DTFS - CHECK A DEC@TAPE FILESYSTEM

## @?OPTIONS

### @?-O [RO,]TYPE
REQUIRE NATIVE, TENEX, OR ITS MEDIA.  WITHOUT -O THE PERSONALITY IS DETECTED
AUTOMATICALLY.

## @?OPERANDS

### @?DEVICE
DECTAPE DEVICE TO CHECK.  THE CURRENT PROBE HELPER SUPPORTS /DEV/DTC0.

## DESCRIPTION

FSCK.DTFS PERFORMS THE DEEP DTFS MEDIA PROBE.  TENEX CHECKING ALSO WALKS FILE
BLOCK CHAINS; NATIVE AND ITS VALIDATE THEIR DIRECTORY AND ALLOCATION SHAPE.
USAGE IS 'FSCK.DTFS [-O [RO,]TYPE] DEVICE'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
